  (text "Named nets: I2C_SCL, I2C_SDA, LOADCELL_DOUT, LOADCELL_SCK, PURGE_PWM, VBAT, 3V3. The HX711 connects to four foil strain gauges laminated under the removable produce tray, while the DRV8837 drives a low-profile purge impeller and louver. All hardware design authorship: jayis1." (at 18 214 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))))
